      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(1) Expenditures of the various agencies for travel expenses shall receive prior approval of the Deputy Mayor and those incurred for lodging and meals shall be limited to audit of the Comptroller to a maximum of $32.00 per day for officials and for employees while traveling out-of-town on official business. Meals consumed while aboard a train or otherwise enroute are to be considered as part of the transportation cost.",
